              This identification is the adjunction isomorphism
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:HomIsomorphismForAdjointFunctors"} (?)
              for the internal hom adjunction
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:InternalHomAdjunction"} (2)
              followed composed with a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unitor"} unitor
              (Def.
              = succeed ")." do
